Maps Label fonts
================

The Map Label fonts in assets/ui/fonts/ are unmodified copies of the files in
the Google Fonts repository (https://github.com/google/fonts, ofl/), each
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Each font's license
text, with its copyright line and any Reserved Font Name, sits beside it:

- IM FELL English: IMFeENrm28P.ttf, OFL-IMFellEnglish.txt
- Cinzel: Cinzel-wght.ttf, OFL-Cinzel.txt
- Uncial Antiqua: UncialAntiqua-Regular.ttf, OFL-UncialAntiqua.txt
- MedievalSharp: MedievalSharp.ttf, OFL-MedievalSharp.txt

Maps Cuba Template
==================

plugins/maibuk-maps/cuba.ts is generated by scripts/build-cuba-template.ts
from Natural Earth 1:10m Admin 1 states and provinces, which is in the public
domain: https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

The source is pinned at
https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector/commit/ca96624a56bd078437bca8184e78163e5039ad19
